0\", \"start\": 456, \"end\": 581, \"text\": \"Weinstein won an ACTRA Award for Best Actress from the Toronto chapter, becoming the youngest actress ever to win that award.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0027-2b4785d68953:d00\", \"start\": 582, \"end\": 596, \"text\": \"It screened on\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0027-2b4785d68953:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 102, \"text\": \"Big Girl (film) Big Girl is a Canadian documentary, directed by Renuka Jeyapalan and released in 2005.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0027-2b4785d68953:d01\", \"start\": 103, \"end\": 230, \"text\": \"The film depicts a battle of wills between a young girl (Samantha Weinstein) and her mother's new boyfriend (Kris Holden-Ried).\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0027-2b4785d68953:d01\", \"start\": 231, \"end\": 445, \"text\": \"It won the Toronto International Film Festival Award for Best Canadian Documentary at the 2005 Toronto International Film Festival, and was nominated for a Genie Award for Best Documentary at the 27th Genie Awards.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0027-2b4785d68953:d01\", \"start\": 446, \"end\": 571, \"text\": \"Weinstein won an ACTRA Award for Best Actress from the Toronto chapter, becoming the youngest actress ever to win that award.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0027-2b4785d68953:d01\", \"start\": 572, \"end\": 589, \"text\": \"It screened on...\"}}, \"candidates\": [{\"candidate_id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"short film\", \"card_ids\": [\"ramdocs-0027-2b4785d68953:d00:c0\"]}, {\"candidate_id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"documentary\", \"card_ids\": [\"ramdocs-0027-2b4785d68953:d01:c0\"]}], \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0027-2b4785d68953:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0027-2b4785d68953:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Big Girl\", \"scope\": \"film genre\", \"claim\": \"Big Girl is a Canadian sho